# {{ name }}

## Tasks

Run these from the repo root:

- `just start {{ name }}` starts the dev server.
- `just build {{ name }}` writes the production output.
- `just test {{ name }}` runs the tests.
- `just lint` lints and type-checks every unit.
- `just format` formats every unit.

The task bodies come from the `package.json` scripts. `.moon/tasks/typescript.yml`
maps each moon task to one script.

## Dependencies

This unit is a member of the pnpm workspace. Add a package with
`pnpm --filter {{ name }} add <package>`. The lockfile stays at the repo root.
